==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 11 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first. Similarly, you are expected to have at least 400% [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]].

Due to the strong pushing power of the Gory Darks, you will need strong anti-Dark units. Some recommended units are [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to dispose of the Gory Darks as quickly as possible. Using [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] to stall the Aliens can also help greatly. Apart from Catellite, other anti-Aliens can also help, like [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] to nuke them (even though it will need to be timed for the Ursamajor).

